WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.770
- Feel like I heard you
started in weddings, right?

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:02.603
Singing weddings?

00:00:02.603 --> 00:00:04.089
- I did weddings and bar mitzvahs.

00:00:04.089 --> 00:00:05.330
- I did too!

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:06.786
I did, I'm not even Jewish!

00:00:06.786 --> 00:00:07.619
(laughing)

00:00:07.619 --> 00:00:09.900
I did bat mitzvahs, bar mitzvahs,

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:10.733
I did all that.

00:00:10.733 --> 00:00:12.180
I did funerals, have
you ever done a funeral?

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:13.470
It's the worst thing you've
ever done in your life.

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:15.720
(laughing)

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.500
- I lied about my age 'cause I thought

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:19.420
people wouldn't hire me,

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:20.420
so I said I was 18,

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:21.940
as though that was any better to be out

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:24.580
with a bunch of 35 year
old men after hours,

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:26.492
at midnight singing.

00:00:26.492 --> 00:00:28.756
I'd drive around illegally in Long Island,

00:00:28.756 --> 00:00:30.090
'cause if you had a junior license,

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:32.590
so you're not supposed to
be driving at that time.

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:35.060
I knew all the--

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:38.000
- The cops are actually here,
to talk to you about it.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.070
(laughing)
I'm just kidding.

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:42.280
So one time this guy had a heart attack

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:44.050
while I was singing, on the dance floor.

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:44.990
It's not funny, I'm sorry.

00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:45.823
I don't mean to laugh.

00:00:45.823 --> 00:00:47.170
- That happened to me in Australia!

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:48.003
- That happened to you?

00:00:48.003 --> 00:00:49.040
It's so freakin' weird.
- Yes!

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.920
And my band leader was kind of mean,

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:51.753
was like cracking the whip,

00:00:51.753 --> 00:00:52.970
he was like, "The show goes on!

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:53.803
You keep singing!"

00:00:53.803 --> 00:00:55.990
And I was like, "But he's
sick, we have to stop!"

00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:57.470
and he made me keep singing.

00:00:57.470 --> 00:00:59.660
And then the bride came over,

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:02.030
and she was like, "You're so insensitive!

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:03.870
Stop singing!"

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:06.080
I was just crying, and I went
over to the Viennese table

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:08.225
and started stuffing my
face with chocolate eclairs.

00:01:08.225 --> 00:01:09.058
- This is the worst!

00:01:09.058 --> 00:01:10.210
- Just like prayed for this man.

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:11.880
He ended up being okay, but.

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:12.788
- Oh, my Gosh.

00:01:12.788 --> 00:01:13.750
(audience clapping)

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:15.683
That's the worst story!

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:17.353
Oh, my God.

00:01:17.353 --> 00:01:18.390
It does suck though,
when you're doing a show,

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:19.223
and all of a sudden you're like,

00:01:19.223 --> 00:01:20.840
what's happening over
there, and you have no idea,

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:21.950
and you feel insensitive.

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:23.440
It's not that, you just didn't even know.

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:24.830
You have in ears in and all that.

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:27.280
- And another time these
kids in the bar mitzvah,

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:29.180
they were throwing food
at me and my friend,

00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:30.013
we were singing.

00:01:30.013 --> 00:01:30.881
We're singing like,

00:01:30.881 --> 00:01:31.990
♪ I'm so excited ♪

00:01:31.990 --> 00:01:33.860
or whatever, and they
were throwing food at us.

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:35.380
And finally we'd just had had it,

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:38.280
so we threw back this chocolate sundae,

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:39.800
and we ran into the bathroom

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:42.350
and we were in the bathroom
just hiding in there.

00:01:42.350 --> 00:01:43.410
Nobody knew.

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:45.240
The band leader was like,
where are those girls,

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:46.363
we need them to sing.

00:01:47.515 --> 00:01:48.910
The little kids were outside the door

00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:51.460
waiting to smash whipped
cream on our heads.

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:53.350
- I need you to start a podcast

00:01:53.350 --> 00:01:55.294
of just random stories about your life.

00:01:55.294 --> 00:01:56.450
- Wedding and bar mitzvah stories.

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:57.283
- Like, what?

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:59.310
Those two stories were gems.

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:00.660
- That's where I got my education,

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:03.470
and just getting a thicker
skin, and performing,

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:05.930
and kinda going with whatever happens.

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:08.600
You have that, you're so in the moment.

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:09.690
- I've done some weird stuff.

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:11.896
I've never had food
thrown at me, God bless.

00:02:11.896 --> 00:02:13.308
(laughing)

00:02:13.308 --> 00:02:14.630
I'm not nice like you.

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:16.303
I would've not handled that well.

00:02:16.303 --> 00:02:17.480
(laughing)

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:19.030
I'd have taken my earrings off.

